ShineTools is a mobile phone application software that can easily debug the inverter through a smart phone. It communicates with the inverter through WiFi or a data collector to realize real-time status monitoring, alarm query, parameter configuration, intelligent diagnosis and other routine maintenance functions. Lightweight equipment near-end debugging platform.

Real-time status monitoring: timely grasp the real-time status of inverters and data collectors;

Alarm query: The easy-to-operate alarm function and flexible alarm display mechanism can quickly obtain fault location information, take timely countermeasures, and improve the efficiency of user fault management, operation and maintenance.

Parameter configuration: simple and safe parameter configuration, and one-stop unified configuration can be realized through the data collector;

BAS-IP Intercom is a free application that enables you to receive video calls from outdoor panels and BAS-IP monitors on a mobile device.

In any part of the world, all you need is the Internet and this application to receive video calls from the BAS-IP devices on a mobile device.

You need to create an account on the free SIP service sip.bas-ip.com. After that, with the help of the application, you need to scan the QR code located in the personal account of the service, and then scan the QR code located on the box with the purchased BAS-IP device. You will immediately get 5 internal numbers and the access to their settings.

Features:
- Support for push notifications about incoming calls;
- Support for push notifications about alarms;
- Option to save photos from the outdoor panel’s camera;
- Option to create a phone book;
- Button for opening the second lock;
- Access to the call archive.
